ing.";s:23:"pro_version_description";s:227:"Enhance your online exams with Moodle Proctoring Pro! Catch tab-switching, monitor clipboard activity, use face recognition for real-time monitoring, and access detailed proctoring reports to ensure fair and secure assessments.";s:16:"pro_version_text";s:53:"Learn more about the Pro version of this plugin here.";s:22:"pro_version_title_text";s:19:"Get Proctoring Pro.";s:24:"proctoring:analyzeimages";s:25:"Proctoring analyze images";s:25:"proctoring:deletecamshots";s:35:"Delete images from proctoring logs.";s:22:"proctoring:getcamshots";s:28:"Proctoring get webcam images";s:22:"proctoring:sendcamshot";s:28:"Proctoring send webcam photo";s:21:"proctoring:viewreport";s:22:"Proctoring view report";s:20:"proctoring_pro_promo";s:20:"Proctoring Pro promo";s:26:"proctoring_pro_promo:admin";s:22:"Detailed admin reports";s:31:"proctoring_pro_promo:adminlist1";s:61:"Provides a detailed view of all participants' proctored logs.";s:31:"proctoring_pro_promo:adminlist2";s:46:"Allows downloading a comprehensive PDF report.";s:36:"proctoring_pro_promo:detectcopypaste";s:28:"Copy-paste forgery detection";s:41:"proctoring_pro_promo:detectcopypastelist1";s:59:"Detects any copy and paste actions during the quiz attempt.";s:41:"proctoring_pro_promo:detectcopypastelist2";s:40:"Logs each attempt to copy or paste text.";s:26:"proctoring_pro_promo:email";s:13:"Email support";s:33:"proctoring_pro_promo:emailsupport";s:43:"Receive direct email support from our team.";s:38:"proctoring_pro_promo:emailsupportlist1";s:49:"Get 24/7 email support for any queries or issues.";s:28:"proctoring_pro_promo:feature";s:26:"Features of Proctoring Pro";s:33:"proctoring_pro_promo:featurelist1";s:47:"Compatible with face recognition service (AWS).";s:33:"proctoring_pro_promo:featurelist2";s:56:"Detect if webcam was enabled for entire time of attempt.";s:33:"proctoring_pro_promo:featurelist3";s:54:"Detect if user has moved to any other application/tab.";s:33:"proctoring_pro_promo:featurelist4";s:46:"Detect if user has resized the browser window.";s:33:"proctoring_pro_promo:featurelist5";s:53:"Detect if copy and paste occurred during the attempt.";s:33:"proctoring_pro_promo:featurelist6";s:35:"Detect if user has pressed F12 key.";s:33:"proctoring_pro_promo:featurelist7";s:59:"Detailed admin report of every event log and webcam images.";s:33:"proctoring_pro_promo:featurelist8";s:34:"Admin summary report of all users.";s:33:"proctoring_pro_promo:featurelist9";s:23:"Email support/bug fixes";s:27:"proctoring_pro_promo:header";s:94:"Secure your online exams with Proctoring Pro cutting-edge technology for unbeatable monitoring";s:30:"proctoring_pro_promo:learnmore";s:10:"Learn more";s:25:"proctoring_pro_promo:mail";s:13:"Contact us at";s:29:"proctoring_pro_promo:namefree";s:17:"Proctoring (Free)";s:28:"proctoring_pro_promo:namepro";s:14:"Proctoring Pro";s:33:"proctoring_pro_promo:pdfgenerator";s:21:"PDF report generation";s:37:"proctoring_pro_promo:pdfgeneratordesc";s:76:"Generates a detailed PDF report for each user, containing all logged events.";s:31:"proctoring_pro_promo:profeature";s:32:"What's new in Proctoring Pro 2.0";s:46:"proctoring_pro_promo:profeaturebulkphotoupload";s:17:"Bulk photo upload";s:50:"proctoring_pro_promo:profeaturebulkphotouploaddesc";s:101:"Allows admins to upload images for multiple users at once via a zip file or upload individual images.";s:44:"proctoring_pro_promo:profeaturehphotofillter";s:15:"Photo filtering";s:48:"proctoring_pro_promo:profeaturehphotofillterdesc";s:123:"Admins can filter users based on whether their photo is uploaded or if the user's face is missing from the captured images.";s:37:"proctoring_pro_promo:screenmonitoring";s:22:"Screen size monitoring";s:42:"proctoring_pro_promo:screenmonitoringlist1";s:59:"Detects any changes in screen size during the quiz attempt.";s:42:"proctoring_pro_promo:screenmonitoringlist2";s:57:"Logs each instance when the user resizes the quiz window.";s:30:"proctoring_pro_promo:subheader";s:34:"Get the Proctoring Pro plugin now.";s:36:"proctoring_pro_promo:suscipiousevent";s:23:"Other suspicious events";s:41:"proctoring_pro_promo:suscipiouseventlist1";s:50:"Detects if the F12 key is pressed during the exam.";s:41:"proctoring_pro_promo:suscipiouseventlist2";s:71:"Logs each instance when the user presses F12 while attempting the quiz.";s:34:"proctoring_pro_promo:tabmonitoring";s:20:"Focus tab monitoring";s:39:"proctoring_pro_promo:tabmonitoringlist1";s:54:"Detects if the user switches to another window or tab.";s:39:"proctoring_pro_promo:tabmonitoringlist2";s:73:"Logs every instance when the user moves away from the exam tab or window.";s:27:"proctoring_pro_promo:webcam";s:16:"Webcam detection";s:32:"proctoring_pro_promo:webcamlist1";s:79:"Detects whether the webcam remained enabled throughout the entire exam attempt.";s:32:"proctoring_pro_promo:webcamlist2";s:47:"Logs any instances when the webcam is disabled.";s:28:"proctoring_pro_promo_heading";s:20:"Proctoring Pro promo";s:17:"proctoring_report";s:17:"Proctoring report";s:16:"proctoringheader";s:143:"<strong>To continue with this quiz attempt you must open your webcam, and it will take some of your pictures randomly during the quiz.</strong>";s:15:"proctoringlabel";s:36:"I agree with the validation process.";s:18:"proctoringrequired";s:26:"Webcam identity validation";s:23:"proctoringrequired_help";s:112:"Enabling proctoring requires students to be monitored using webcam and screen recording during the quiz attempt.";s:24:"proctoringrequiredoption";s:35:"Enable webcam capture by Proctoring";s:19:"proctoringstatement";s:68:"This exam requires webcam access.<br />(Please allow webcam access).";s:13:"provide_image";s:34:"Please provide an image to upload.";s:21:"quizaccess_proctoring";s:21:"Quizaccess Proctoring";s:9:"quiztitle";s:10:"Quiz Title";s:10:"reportpage";s:25:"Course Proctoring Summary";s:29:"setting:adminimagedescription";s:121:"These images will be used as base images for face verification. Please ensure each image contains a clearly visible face.";s:22:"setting:adminimagepage";s:20:"Proctoring User List";s:14:"setting:bs_api";s:14:"BS service API";s:18:"setting:bs_api_key";s:10:"BS API key";s:22:"setting:bs_api_keydesc";s:51:"Enter the API key for the BS face-matching service.";s:18:"setting:bs_apidesc";s:24:"BS service API endpoint.";s:32:"setting:bs_apifacematchthreshold";s:25:"Face match threshold (BS)";s:39:"setting:bs_bs_apifacematchthresholddesc";s:83:"The percentage threshold for the face verification using BS service. (Default: 68%)";s:20:"setting:camshotdelay";s:41:"The delay between webcam images (seconds)";s:25:"setting:camshotdelay_desc";s:71:"The given value will be the delay in seconds between each webcam image.";s:20:"setting:camshotwidth";s:38:"The width of the webcam image (pixels)";s:25:"setting:camshotwidth_desc";s:101:"The given value will be the width of the webcam image. The image height will be scaled to match this.";s:17:"setting:facematch";s:31:"Number of face matches per quiz";s:21:"setting:facematchdesc";s:66:"Number of face match checks. Use 0 or less to check all snapshots.";s:17:"setting:fc_method";s:17:"Face match method";s:21:"setting:fc_methoddesc";s:47:"Service used to match faces. Options: BS, None.";s:19:"setting:fcthreshold";s:31:"Face match threshold percentage";s:23:"setting:fcthresholddesc";s:31:"Face match threshold percentage";s:24:"setting:uploaduserimages";s:27:"Upload base image for users";s:17:"setting:userslist";s:18:"Upload user images";s:25:"settings:deleteallsuccess";s:33:"Successfully deleted all records.";s:31:"settings:deleteuserimagesuccess";s:32:"Successfully deleted user image.";s:24:"settings:fcheckquizstart";s:29:"Face validation on quiz start";s:29:"settings:fcheckquizstart_desc";s:74:"If enabled, users must validate their face before they can start the quiz.";s:26:"settingscontroll:deleteall";s:48:"Delete all record that captured during the exams";s:37:"settingscontroll:deleteallcourseimage";s:101:"Delete all images and records of students that were captured during the exams for <b>this course</b>.";s:37:"settingscontroll:deletealldescription";s:107:"This will permanently delete all captured images and proctoring related data. This action cannot be undone.";s:34:"settingscontroll:deletealllinktext";s:18:"Delete all records";s:6:"status";s:17:"Validation status";s:13:"studentreport";s:14:"Student report";s:6:"submit";s:6:"Submit";s:15:"summarypagedesc";s:193:"In this report you will find the summary of proctoring report for this course and its quizzes. You can delete all the data related to quiz and course. It will delete image file as well as logs.";s:18:"task:delete_images";s:18:"Delete images task";s:12:"timemodified";s:13:"Last modified";s:18:"upload_first_image";s:25:"Please upload user image.";s:12:"upload_image";s:12:"Upload image";s:20:"upload_image_heading";s:17:"Upload user image";s:17:"upload_image_info";s:106:"Upload images to the system for user verification. This helps ensure the integrity of your online quizzes.";s:22:"upload_image_link_text";s:33:"Click here to Upload user images.";s:20:"upload_image_message";s:60:"Proctoring needs user images to authenticate their identity.";s:18:"upload_image_title";s:31:"Upload image for face detection";s:15:"uploadimagehere";s:31:"Click here to upload the image.";s:4:"user";s:5:"Users";s:23:"user_image_not_uploaded";s:52:"User image is not uploaded. Please upload the image.";s:31:"user_image_not_uploaded_teacher";s:82:"User image is not uploaded. Please contact with administrator to upload the image.";s:20:"userimagenotuploaded";s:27:"User image is not uploaded.";s:8:"userlist";s:9:"User list";s:8:"username";s:9:"User Name";s:10:"users_list";s:32:"Proctoring for Moodle Users list";s:27:"users_list_info_description";s:443:"This page lists all users who require a base image for proctoring.
